	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Libelli duo sunt mihi, alter <persName>Theodori Heneti</persName> contra Interim brevis; non e<lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nim habet ultra tres quaterniones; alter <persName ref="p2104">Iusti Menii</persName>, qui titulum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>habet: <foreign xml:lang="de">"Von der notwehr underricht."</foreign></s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Vellem utrunque de novo impressum iri, <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>priorem tamen lubentius, ut breviter docerentur homines de pernicioso Interim.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Posterior habet defectum, quare de eo non ita curo nunc.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Postquam autem <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>apud nos cautum est, ne descriptores librorum aliquid imprimant, quod <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>sit contra Interim, cogitavi de officina vestra, si illa sit forsitan adhuc liberior, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quamvis neque locus neque typographus addendus esset.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Volui hanc <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ob rem scribere ad te, si quid huius, quod dico, possit impetrari; rescribas <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>igitur in tempore.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Hodie praelectę sunt mihi literę ex <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName>, in quibus illud est a legatis relatum: <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quatuor septimanas concessas, intra quas respondendum sit <foreign xml:lang="de">ja <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>oder nein.</foreign></s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Et ingentes minas adiunctas, si negarint veneficum Interim.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Ex urbe migrarunt mercatores ditissimi et nobiles usque <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ad xlviij; hinc territi sunt reliqui in hunc modum querulantes: nimirum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>grave periculum nobis imminet, quia tanti viri abeunt.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Profecto <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>non sentiunt mecum; ego enim gauderem, quod tutior mihi eis absentibus a <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>proditione viderer.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Concionatores fortiter adhuc agunt, quicquid tandem <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>efficient.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>D. <persName ref="p18137">Io[annes] Marpachius</persName> tandem rediit e <placeName ref="l749">Saxonia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l1682">Misnia</placeName>, <placeName ref="l776">Thuringia</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/><placeName ref="l213">Hassia</placeName>; nam ad illas regiones missus erat.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Maximum narrat esse <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>consensum ministrorum et populorum nec paucorum principum atque nobilium <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>in syncera permanendi confessione Christi.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Filii tres et uxor capti ele<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ctoris cum omni provincia ipsis reliqua, ad quam adhuc pertinent 7 comites <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>et numerosa nobilitas magnaque oppidorum <placeName ref="l776">Thuringię</placeName> copia, <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>magna constantia decreverunt et hęc sua reliqua relinquere quam puram <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>dei confessionem.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">In eadem sententia sunt cunctę civitates liberę <placeName ref="l749">Saxonicę</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName>Balthice</placeName> cum principibus <persName ref="p18503">Mechelburgensi Heinricho</persName>, <placeName ref="l743">Pomeranis</placeName> duobus, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><placeName ref="l1750">Luneburgensibus</placeName> pupillis, <persName ref="p20434">marchione Ioanne</persName>, fratre electoris, <persName ref="p8616">marchione Alberto</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>successore constituto <placeName ref="l2562">Pruteni</placeName>, patrui eius, qui ei impetravit a <placeName ref="l2472">Polono</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>et sororem in uxorem et successionem in ducatu suo.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Hęc nolui te n<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>escire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Narratur a nobili <placeName ref="l832">Gallo</placeName> Pictones esse in armis propter evangelium; <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>academiam <placeName>Dolosensem</placeName> vi rapuisse captivum quendam evangelicum e <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>carcere; in reliqua etiam <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> mirabiliter agi propter evangelium idem.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Expectamus, quid sequuturum sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale in Christo cum <persName ref="p8011">Gvalthero</persName>, <persName ref="p8459">Othone</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>et reliquis.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 4. Septembris anno 1548.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8418">O[svaldus] Myc[onius]</persName></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>D. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>doctissimo pientissimoque, fratri <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>in domino suo venerando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
